        "username": "fjur",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-08-27T18:55:49.467Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Chief_Lackey_Rich\" data-post=\"20\" data-topic=\"29468\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Chief_Lackey_Rich:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>FWIW, there’s also a DC character (probably several versions of him, even) named Mister E.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>There is also a <a href=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Marvel_Comics_characters:_M#Mister_E\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Marvel Comics Mister E</a>, a <a href=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Scooby-Doo_characters#Mr._E_(Ricky_Owens)\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Scooby-Doo Mister E</a>, and a <a href=\"https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Ninjago_characters#Sons_of_Garmadon\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">LEGO Mister E</a>. And my high school English teacher, who went by Mr. E.</p>\n<p>The point is, I think that it’s a name that’s been used so many different times by so many different people, it doesn’t really matter anymore is someone new starts using it.</p>",
