        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/i/e0b2c6/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2022-08-29T03:47:10.029Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Additional 'Miss’es:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Miss Direction (combination of perfect sense of direction with reality perception/distortion powers?) - often seen hanging out with Miss Guided.</li>\n<li>Miss Ewe (sheep powers)</li>\n<li>Miss Fortune (who amazingly doesn’t seem to be an official superhero yet, though there is a LoL character of that name…).</li>\n<li>Miss Fire (ditto, except for the LoL bit…)</li>\n<li>Miss Conception (some sort of manifester ala Idealist?)</li>\n<li>EDIT: Miss Elaneous (okay, I’ll stop.  Probably…)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>(EDIT: Just realised Miss Direction was already done.  Oops!)</p>",
